{"id":"W8996a7fe7283a3b9c2a31f37","zh":"平稳性指标","en":"","name":"平稳性指标","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W8996a7fe7283a3b9c2a31f37","text":"平稳性指标","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sfd2b66894e398359f3f7","source_id":"P116","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"对于车体平稳性指标(垂、横向指标限值相同),行车速度越高,对轨道不平顺谱的要求越高,表现为k值减小;而对于车体振动加速度,由于其指标限值随车体增加亦对应的有所提高,其转换系数k完全基于车辆-轨道耦合动力学模型和2.","citations":[{"source_id":"P116","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"S85b54b23ea98036d044a","source_id":"P116","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"为了建立较为细致的青藏铁路轨道不平顺界限谱,取80、100、120、140km/h 4个速度等级,取车体垂、横向振动加速度,垂、横向平稳性指标4个动力指标(因为本文所分析的轨道谱无法表达短波不平顺,故未取轮重减载率指标;由前面的分析可知,脱轨系数极难超限,故亦未取之),取安全裕量系数γl=1.","citations":[{"source_id":"P116","page":5,"page_end":5}]}],"sources":{"P116":{"id":"P116","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺界限谱研究","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明,陈宪麦,高建敏","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.05.015","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-research-on-track-irregularity-boundary-psds-of-qinghai-tibet-railway"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"评价车体振动平稳程度，本文分别考察垂向和横向指标。","language":"zh","source_id":"P116","paper_slug":"2018-research-on-track-irregularity-boundary-psds-of-qinghai-tibet-railway","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺界限谱研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wdbe90d59c11f25097edd4222","name":"Ride quality index","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wdbe90d59c11f25097edd4222","name":"Ride quality index","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"Wdbe90d59c11f25097edd4222"